# Day 8 – Order Day Sales Analysis

## Objective
Identify which day of the week drives the most sales, and which products
perform best on each specific day. Also compare overall weekday vs weekend
sales to spot broader shopping patterns.

## What I Built
- Added `OrderDayName`, `OrderDayNumber`, and `DayType` (Weekday/Weekend)
  columns in Power Query, derived from Order Date
- Sorted `OrderDayName` by `OrderDayNumber` so charts display Monday → Sunday
  in correct order instead of alphabetically
- Built an interactive dashboard with:
  - A day-of-week slicer (Mon–Sun)
  - Top 10 products by sales, filtered by the selected day
  - KPI cards for Total Sales and Total Orders (reactive to slicer)
  - Top 5 products table for the selected day
  - A weekday vs weekend sales comparison (static, for overall context)

